      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امعز</span></b>  <i>He,</i> (a man, A,) or <i>it,</i> (a people, S,)
<i>became abundant in goats; his</i> or <i>its, goats became abundant,</i> or <i>numerous;</i> (S, A, K;) as
also, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعِزَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزَ</span></b> , (K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعَزٌ</span>. (TK.)

